// Build fails without a root Secrets.xcconfig — observed error: "Unable to open base configuration reference file '<repo>/Secrets.xcconfig'".
// A checkout without that file fails the build until this example is copied to the repo root; this is intentional (the attached file is the gitignored one so no real key can ship in git).
// Copy this file to ../Secrets.xcconfig before building.
// The real file is gitignored and must never be committed.
// CI recipe — copy the example to Secrets.xcconfig, then pass xcodebuild a YOUTUBE_API_KEY=... command-line override so the real key never touches disk in CI.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY = REPLACE_ME
